    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Left ankle pain and swelling; no wrist or hand pain</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Known left foot drop and hand weakness, unchanged; no head injury or faintness</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Grazed palms only</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No breathlessness</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

